# W11b, host c (k5): hosts a Public instance in stag0101 and plays there while a's departure is prompted and taken back.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log c hosts in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until epoch>=@300 fail stagechange
log c done
